  },
  "duration": 141.97,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 9.938,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that after Alma had made an end of speaking unto the people of the church, which was established in the city of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 10.118,
      "end": 18.152,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he ordained priests and elders, by laying on his hands according to the order of God, to preside and watch over the church.",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 18.832,
      "end": 25.287,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that whosoever did not belong to the church who repented of their sins",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 25.467,
      "end": 27.928,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "were baptized unto repentance,",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 28.108,
      "end": 30.105,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and were received into the church.",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 30.785,
      "end": 35.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it also came to pass that whosoever did belong to the church",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 35.702,
      "end": 40.253,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that did not repent of their wickedness and humble themselves before God\u2014",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 40.433,
      "end": 43.87,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I mean those who were lifted up in the pride of their hearts\u2014",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 44.05,
      "end": 45.675,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the same were rejected,",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 45.855,
      "end": 47.991,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their names were blotted out,",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 48.171,
      "end": 52.258,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that their names were not numbered among those of the righteous.",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 52.938,
      "end": 57.954,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus they began to establish the order of the church in the city of Zarahemla.",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 58.634,
      "end": 63.092,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now I would that ye should understand that the word of God was liberal unto all,",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 63.272,
      "end": 69.263,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that none were deprived of the privilege of assembling themselves together to hear the word of God.",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 69.943,
      "end": 75.562,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless the children of God were commanded that they should gather themselves together oft,",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 75.742,
      "end": 78.668,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and join in fasting and mighty prayer",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 78.848,
      "end": 82.517,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in behalf of the welfare of the souls of those who knew not God.",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 83.197,
      "end": 87.144,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that when Alma had made these regulations",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 87.324,
      "end": 88.996,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he departed from them,",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 89.176,
      "end": 93.031,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, from the church which was in the city of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 93.211,
      "end": 97.994,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and went over upon the east of the river Sidon, into the valley of Gideon,",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 98.174,
      "end": 100.171,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there having been a city built,",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 100.351,
      "end": 102.534,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was called the city of Gideon,",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 102.714,
      "end": 105.454,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was in the valley that was called Gideon,",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 105.634,
      "end": 110.278,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "being called after the man who was slain by the hand of Nehor with the sword.",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 110.958,
      "end": 114.441,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Alma went and began to declare the word of God",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 114.621,
      "end": 125.581,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto the church which was established in the valley of Gideon, according to the revelation of the truth of the word which had been spoken by his fathers,",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 125.761,
      "end": 132.727,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and according to the spirit of prophecy which was in him, according to the testimony of Jesus Christ, the Son of God,",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 132.907,
      "end": 135.972,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who should come to redeem his people from their sins,",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 136.152,
      "end": 138.567,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the holy order by which he was called.",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 138.747,
      "end": 140.28,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus it is written.",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 140.46,
      "end": 141.296,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amen.",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    }
  ]
}